<h1 class="page-title">Music</h1>
<p class="sec__label">Performance · recording · production</p>
<div class="prose">
  <p>Music is the common denominator and the foundation of all of my interactive sound work. Beyond electronics and code I make music. I write, record, and produce out of a home studio, and play guitar, banjo, lap steel,  Dobro, and pedal steel — more or less anything with strings.</p>

